Evaluation output lands here.

Deliberately empty in version control. Every run so far used the fake embedding
provider, whose vectors are random, so the numbers it produced measure nothing.
Committing them -- even carrying their disclaimer -- risks someone quoting a
figure that was never a result.

Populate this directory by setting EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=openai in .env and running:

    python evaluation/run_experiments.py

Then commit experiments.json and experiments.md, and fill in the results table
in the README from them.
